{"id":"sinceramente","lemma":"sinceramente","pos":"adv","rank":1979,"glosses":["sincerely","honestly"],"ipa":"/sinˌθeɾaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sinceramente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sinceramente, no me gusta.","en":"Frankly, I don't like him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519398","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"¿Sinceramente piensas ganar?","en":"Do you really expect to win?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451071","words":[null,{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"to gain"}]},{"text":"Sinceramente creí que íbamos a ganar.","en":"I really thought we were going to win.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300332","words":[null,{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to gain"}]},{"text":"Espero sinceramente que te mejores pronto.","en":"I sincerely hope you'll get well soon.","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"better","l":"mejor"},{"g":"prompt, on time"}]},{"text":"Sinceramente, no estoy muy impresionado por su idea.","en":"Frankly, I'm not that impressed with his idea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768117","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"impressed"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"idea"}]}]}